//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/9812/1332/files/IMG_5397.jpg?v=1767143427\", \"width\": 1024, \"height\": 1024}, {\"id\": 55042347958644, \"created_at\": \"2025-12-31T06:40:25+05:30\", \"position\": 5, \"updated_at\": \"2025-12-31T06:40:27+05:30\", \"product_id\": 14900808450420, \"variant_ids\": [], \"src\": \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/9812/1332/files/IMG_5400.jpg?v=1767143427\", \"width\": 1024, \"height\": 1024}], \"options\": [{\"name\": \"Size\", \"position\": 1, \"values\": [\"XS\", \"S\", \"M\", \"L\", \"XL\"]}, {\"name\": \"Select Items\", \"position\": 2, \"values\": [\"Combo (Top+Skirt)\", \"Top Only\", \"Skirt Only\"]}]}, {\"id\": 14900803567988, \"title\": \"Mira Modular White Co-ord Set\", \"handle\": \"mira-modular-white-co-ord-set\", \"body_html\": \"<p>This white co-ord set is crafted in Tencel twill fabric, a soft, breathable fabric made from wood pulp, chosen for its fluid drape and mindful impact. Designed with interchangeable collars, each detail offers a distinct expression of style. Wear it without a collar for a clean mandarin collar look. Add the shirt collar for a classic, structured feel. Or replace it with the delicate lace collar when you want something softer and more feminine. Finished with embroidered buttons and detachable sleeves that can be worn as 3/4-length or full sleeves, this set shifts effortlessly with your mood and moment. One co-ord. Many identities. Because true style is meant to evolve with you. Wear it your way. Wear it with purpose.</p>\", \"published_at\": \"2025-12-31T06:29:43+05:30\", \"created_at\": \"2025-12-31T06:29:41+05:30\", \"updated_at\": \"2026-11-18T22:25:42+05:30\", \"vendor\": \"Ruchs\", \"product_type\": \"2 piece dress\", \"tags\": [\"Interchangeable Collar\", \"Luxury Womenswear\", \"modern silhouette\", \"Sustainable Fashion\", \"Tencel Twill Outfit\", \"White Co-ord Set\", \"Women's Outfit\"], \"variants\": [{\"id\": 53787056111988, \"title\": \"Combo (Top+Bottom) / XS - S\", \"option1\